# Third-party material

## Payment marks (`frontend/src/spofy/components/payment-mark.tsx`)

Trademarks belong to their owners and are shown only to name a way to pay.

- Faster Payments System (СБП) — the official sign from the SBP site (https://sbp.nspk.ru, the
  header logo for phones), © NSPK JSC.
- Telegram Stars — the star from the open Telegram Web A client
  (https://github.com/Ajaxy/telegram-tt, `src/assets/icons/star/GoldStarFill.svg`, GPL-3.0).
- xRocket — the sign from the service's site (https://xrocket.exchange).
- Visa, Tether — outlines from Simple Icons 16.37.0 (https://simpleicons.org, CC0 1.0), brand
  colours. Mastercard — two circles in the brand colours.

Changes (2026-11-13): the signs are fitted into a 40×40 field on a white tile, without captions.
The same set is used in the web cabinet (bedolaga-cabinet, `src/components/PaymentMethodIcon.tsx`).
